  },
  {
    "description": "Import a whole route from one document: give space_id for a new draft, or route_id and draft_revision to replace an editable route's draft. All of it or nothing; a published version is never touched. Read the format in the resource learning-routes://guides/route-format, and its JSON Schema in learning-routes://schemas/route-document.",
    "name": "import_route",
  },
  {
    "description": "Publish a route's draft on the creator's public page, where students can start it. Do this only when the person asks. Answers with the public address.",
